From 6daf91531ccdf0ade6f0b5907757db64f5f71110 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dev <dev@example.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 22:36:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] build: lower minSdk to 16 and pin API 16 capable
